      <title>OpenAI首席科学家提议为AI发展设统一限制，并以“困惑度”衡量智能进展</title>
      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261123-170749&amp;cat=tech&amp;event=evt_5266c038ddf8</link>
